                    [
                        {
                            "id": "8",
                            "text": " The Impact of the Introduction to Stage Two Counselling Skills on my Personal Development "
                        }
                    ]
                ],
                "placeHolder": "Type your Title here.",
                "id": "8"
            }
        },
        {
            "structure": {
                "para": [
                    {
                        "id": "100",
                        "text": "Move 1: Connecting theory to practice"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "101",
                        "text": "This connects the theory you have studied to your experience."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "notes": {
                "para": []
            },
            "content": {
                "para": [],
                "placeHolder": "",
                "id": ""
            }
        },
        {
            "structure": {
                "para": [
                    {
                        "id": "10",
                        "text": "Steps 1 and 2"
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "11",
                        "text": "Step 1. Set out the general framework, using a quotation if relevant.\nStep 2. Connect the theory to your experience."
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "12",
                        "text": "TIP Connect what you have read to what you have personally experienced.",
                        "tip": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            "notes": {
                "para": []
            },
            "content": {
                "para": [
                    [
                        {
                            "id": "14",
                            "text": " Carl Rogers argued "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "13",
                            "text": " that becoming a counsellor is not just the acquiring of a set of skills, but is a way of being; utilizing the three core conditions is a key aspect of this "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "15",
                            "text": " (Sanders, 2002: 67) "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "13",
                            "text": " . Since embarking on the Introduction to Counselling Skills course, "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "16",
                            "text": " I have been made aware of Rogers' core conditions "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "13",
                            "text": " of "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "17",
                            "text": " genuineness "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "13",
                            "text": " , "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "18",
                            "text": " empathy "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "13",
                            "text": " and "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "19",
                            "text": " acceptance "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "13",
                            "text": " . "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "20",
                            "text": " I believe I possessed elements of these unknowingly; "
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "114",
                            "text": " however, becoming conscious of them has enabled me to incorporate them into my being and to develop personally. "
                        }
                    ]
                ],
                "placeHolder": "Type Move 1 here.",
                "id": "13"
            }
        },
        {
            "structure": {
                "para": []
            },
            "notes": {
                "para": []
            },
            "content": {
                "para": [
                    [
